Ä                                                                               
Ä -Script for removing old xls files from the wb01 (ACCE) directory             
Ä -(Files created in BMP WB1103 in WB11S1 and transferred by WB1103FT)          
Ä -The script finds and deletes all xls files not created today.                
Ä                                                                               
echo Å(date '+%b.%e') > /tmp/wb01d                                              
chmod 777 /tmp/wb01d                                                            
ls -lrt /app/vccs/qase/wb01/data/*.xls!grep -vf /tmp/wb01d > /tmp/wb01l         
chmod 777 /tmp/wb01l                                                            
cut -c 55- < /tmp/wb01l ! sed 's/^/rm /' > /tmp/wb01_rm                         
chmod 777 /tmp/wb01_rm                                                          
/tmp/wb01_rm                                                                    
